<section class="section">
  <div class="section-narrow gs-inner">
    <h2>Getting started</h2>
    <p>Prerequisites: <a href="https://mise.jdx.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">mise</a>, Rust stable, Flutter (pinned in <code>mise.toml</code>), and a working sound device.</p>
    <pre class="code-block"><code>{`git clone https://github.com/geovannimp/mixar.git
cd mixar
mise install
npm install
npm run flutter:dev`}</code></pre>
    <p class="gs-note">
      Headless tests can use <code>backend = "null"</code> so they do not need an audio device.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

